BeastKingDeathEvent:
ASMC ScavengerASMC|1
BNE 0x3 0xc 0x0 //if scavenger true, skip conditional check
SVAL 0x1 BeastKing
SVAL 0x2 0x1 //poison status
ASMC StatusConditionalASMC|1
BEQ 0x1 0xc 0x0
LABEL 0x3
Text(BeastKingPoisonedDeath)
ENUT BeastKingConditionalFlag
GOTO 0x2
LABEL 0x1 //no poison
Text(BeastKingDeath)
LABEL 0x2
ENDA

BenthusDeathEvent:
ASMC ScavengerASMC|1
BNE 0x3 0xc 0x0 //if scavenger true, skip conditional check
SVAL 0x1 BossBenthus2
SVAL 0x2 3 //headbind
ASMC StatusConditionalASMC|1
BEQ 0x1 0xc 0x0
LABEL 0x3
Text(BenthusHeadBoundDeath)
ENUT BenthusConditionalFlag
GOTO 0x2
LABEL 0x1 //no poison
Text(BenthusDeath)
LABEL 0x2
ENDA

RanaDeathEvent:
MUSCSLOW 0x7fff
Text(EndgameARanaDeath)
ENDA
CRouteRanaDeathEvent:
MUSCSLOW 0x7fff
Text(RanaDeath)
ENDA

